  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Finely chop or crush garlic. Roughly chop tomato and brown onion.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Drain and rinse black beans. Transfer to a bowl and roughly mash.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/635a8a99e699fc9fe400e920/step-f2db9a29.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! The spice blend is hot, use less if you're sensitive to heat.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion until just softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in garlic, tomato paste and spicy taco seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add beans and the butter and cook until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir in the water and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins. Lightly mash. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/635a8a99e699fc9fe400e920/step-32b2f515.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Arrange tortillas over lined oven tray. Divide bean mixture over half of each tortilla and top with Cheddar cheese. Fold each tortilla over and gently press gently with a spatula.\n• Brush or spray tortillas with a drizzle of olive oil and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/635a8a99e699fc9fe400e920/step-1483ecaf.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Bake quesadillas until golden and cheese has melted, 10-12 mins. (Place baking paper and a second oven tray on quesadillas if they unfold in the oven.)\n• Meanwhile, add tomato, and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil to the charred corn. Toss to combine and season.\n• Divide quesadillas between plates. Top with with sour cream and salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/635a8a99e699fc9fe400e920/step-a7d1c2a4.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
